{"schema":1,"revision":91935641,"page":{"pageid":403157,"title":"棉花軟糖","displayTitle":"棉花軟糖","variant":"zh-tw"},"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"zh-Hant-TW\" dir=\"ltr\"><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r95173172\">.mw-parser-output .hatnote{font-size:small}.mw-parser-output div.hatnote{padding-left:2em;margin-bottom:0.8em;margin-top:0.8em}.mw-parser-output .hatnote-notice-img::after{content:\"\\202f \\202f \\202f \\202f \"}.mw-parser-output .hatnote-notice-img-small::after{content:\"\\202f \\202f \"}.mw-parser-output .hatnote+.mw-empty-elt+.hatnote{margin-top:-0.5em}body.skin-minerva .mw-parser-output .hatnote-notice-img,body.skin-minerva .mw-parser-output .hatnote-notice-img-small{display:none}@media print{body.ns-0 .mw-parser-output .hatnote{display:none!important}}</style><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote navigation-not-searchable\"><span class=\"noviewer hatnote-notice-img\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Wikipedia:%E6%B6%88%E6%AD%A7%E4%B9%89\" title=\"Wikipedia:消歧義\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fb/Confusion_grey.svg/40px-Confusion_grey.svg.png?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"19\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fb/Confusion_grey.svg/60px-Confusion_grey.svg.png?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"260\" data-file-height=\"200\" /></a></span><b>提示</b>：此條目的主題不是<b><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%A3%89%E8%8A%B1%E7%B3%96_(%E6%A3%89%E7%B5%AE%E7%8B%80)\" title=\"棉花糖 (棉絮狀)\">棉花糖 (棉絮狀)</a></b>。</div> \n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r95173184\">.mw-parser-output .ambox{border:1px solid #a2a9b1;border-left:10px solid #36c;background-color:#fbfbfb;box-sizing:border-box}.mw-parser-output .ambox+.mw-empty-elt+.ambox,.mw-parser-output .ambox+.mw-empty-elt+.mw-empty-elt+.ambox,.mw-parser-output .ambox+.mw-empty-elt+.mw-empty-elt+.mw-empty-elt+.ambox{margin-top:-1px}html body.mediawiki .mw-parser-output .ambox.mbox-small-left{margin:4px 1em 4px 0;overflow:hidden;width:238px;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:88%;line-height:1.25em}.mw-parser-output .ambox-speedy{border-left:10px solid #b32424;background-color:#fee7e6}.mw-parser-output .ambox-delete{border-left:10px solid #b32424}.mw-parser-output .ambox-content{border-left:10px solid #f28500}.mw-parser-output .ambox-style{border-left:10px solid #fc3}.mw-parser-output .ambox-move{border-left:10px solid #9932cc}.mw-parser-output .ambox-protection{border-left:10px solid #a2a9b1}.mw-parser-output .ambox .mbox-text{border:none;padding:0.25em 0.5em;width:100%}.mw-parser-output .ambox .mbox-image{border:none;padding:2px 0 2px 0.5em;text-align:center}.mw-parser-output .ambox .mbox-imageright{border:none;padding:2px 0.5em 2px 0;text-align:center}.mw-parser-output .ambox .mbox-empty-cell{border:none;padding:0;width:1px}.mw-parser-output .ambox .mbox-image-div{width:52px}@media(min-width:720px){.mw-parser-output .ambox{margin:0 10%}}@media screen{html.skin-theme-clientpref-night .mw-parser-output .ambox-speedy{background-color:#300!important}}@media screen and (prefers-color-scheme:dark){html.skin-theme-clientpref-os .mw-parser-output .ambox-speedy{background-color:#300!important}}@media print{body.ns-0 .mw-parser-output .ambox{display:none!important}}</style><table class=\"box-Refimprove plainlinks metadata ambox ambox-content\" role=\"presentation\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"mbox-image\"><div class=\"mbox-image-div\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Tango-nosources.svg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4e/Tango-nosources.svg/60px-Tango-nosources.svg.png?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"45\" height=\"45\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4e/Tango-nosources.svg/120px-Tango-nosources.svg.png?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"48\" data-file-height=\"48\" /></a></span></div></td><td class=\"mbox-text\"><div class=\"mbox-text-span\">此條目<b>需要補充更多<a href=\"/wiki/Wikipedia:%E5%88%97%E6%98%8E%E6%9D%A5%E6%BA%90\" title=\"Wikipedia:列明來源\">來源</a></b>。<span class=\"hide-when-compact\"></span> <small class=\"date-container\"><i>(<span class=\"date\">2020年10月1日</span>)</i></small><span class=\"hide-when-compact\"><br /><small>請協助補充多方面<a href=\"/wiki/Wikipedia:%E5%8F%AF%E9%9D%A0%E6%9D%A5%E6%BA%90\" title=\"Wikipedia:可靠來源\">可靠來源</a>以<a class=\"external text\" data-mw-original-href=\"//zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E6%A3%89%E8%8A%B1%E8%BB%9F%E7%B3%96&amp;action=edit\" href=\"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E6%A3%89%E8%8A%B1%E8%BB%9F%E7%B3%96&amp;action=edit\">改善這篇條目</a>，<a href=\"/wiki/Wikipedia:%E5%8F%AF%E4%BE%9B%E6%9F%A5%E8%AF%81\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Wikipedia:可供查證\">無法查證</a>的內容可能會因為<a href=\"/wiki/Template:Fact\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Template:Fact\">異議提出</a>而被移除。<br />致使用者：請搜尋一下條目的標題（來源搜尋：<span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"//www.google.com/search?&amp;as_eq=wikipedia&amp;q=%22%E6%A3%89%E8%8A%B1%E8%BB%9F%E7%B3%96%22\">\"棉花軟糖\"</a> &#8212; <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"//www.google.com/search?q=%22%E6%A3%89%E8%8A%B1%E8%BB%9F%E7%B3%96%22\">網頁</a>、<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"//www.google.com/search?tbm=nws&amp;q=&amp;as_src=-newswire+-wire+-presswire+-PR+-press+-release+-wikipedia&amp;q=%22%E6%A3%89%E8%8A%B1%E8%BB%9F%E7%B3%96%22\">新聞</a>、<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"//books.google.com/books?&amp;as_brr=0&amp;as_pub=-icon&amp;q=%22%E6%A3%89%E8%8A%B1%E8%BB%9F%E7%B3%96%22\">書籍</a>、<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"//scholar.google.com/scholar?&amp;q=%22%E6%A3%89%E8%8A%B1%E8%BB%9F%E7%B3%96%22\">學術</a>、<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"//www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&amp;safe=off&amp;q=%22%E6%A3%89%E8%8A%B1%E8%BB%9F%E7%B3%96%22\">圖像</a></span>），以檢查網路上是否存在該主題的更多可靠來源（<a href=\"/wiki/Wikipedia:%E5%8F%AF%E9%9D%A0%E6%9D%A5%E6%BA%90\" title=\"Wikipedia:可靠來源\">判定指引</a>）。</small></span></div></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div id=\"noteTA-91ce81bb\" class=\"noteTA\"><div class=\"noteTA-group\"><div data-noteta-group-source=\"module\" data-noteta-group=\"Food\"></div></div></div>\n<figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Pink_Marshmallows.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/ca/Pink_Marshmallows.jpg/250px-Pink_Marshmallows.jpg?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"267\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/ca/Pink_Marshmallows.jpg/500px-Pink_Marshmallows.jpg?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"750\" data-file-height=\"1000\" /></a><figcaption>粉紅色的棉花糖</figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>棉花糖</b>（英語：<span lang=\"en\">marshmallow</span>），又稱<b>棉花軟糖</b>，是一種形狀如<a href=\"/wiki/%E6%A3%89%E8%8A%B1\" title=\"棉花\">棉花</a>的軟糖，擁有多種顏色，常見的如白色等。\n</p>\n<meta property=\"mw:PageProp/toc\" />\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"歷史\"><span id=\".E6.AD.B7.E5.8F.B2\"></span>歷史</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E6%A3%89%E8%8A%B1%E8%BB%9F%E7%B3%96&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"編輯章節：歷史\"><span>編輯</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p>棉花糖源自<a href=\"/wiki/%E5%8F%A4%E5%9F%83%E5%8F%8A\" title=\"古埃及\">古埃及</a>。大約公元前2000年前，古埃及就有現在稱為棉花糖的甜點。當時只有皇室及祭祀神明時才有機會享受到這種特殊的甜點。棉花糖由生長在<a href=\"/wiki/%E8%8D%89%E6%B3%BD\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"草澤\">野地沼澤</a>的葵類植物<a href=\"/wiki/%E8%8D%AF%E8%9C%80%E8%91%B5\" title=\"藥蜀葵\">藥蜀葵</a>所製成。棉花糖的英語「Marshmallow」的來源就是由植物名稱（Mallow）及其所生長的環境（Marsh）組合而成。\n</p><p>古埃及人自藥蜀葵的根部搾出汁液後混合堅果及蜂蜜，可供古埃及人治療喉嚨不適及消化系統疾病，而把汁液與<a href=\"/wiki/%E8%9C%82%E8%9C%9C\" title=\"蜂蜜\">蜂蜜</a>混和，可以製成一種<a href=\"/wiki/%E5%96%89%E7%B3%96\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"喉糖\">喉糖</a><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>。\n</p><p>直到十九世紀初，藥蜀葵被引入法國。法國的廚師發現藥蜀葵的黏液與水混合後會形成濃濃的凝膠狀，於是發明了把藥蜀葵的黏液與糖漿、蛋白、<a href=\"/wiki/%E9%A6%99%E8%8D%89%E8%98%AD\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"香草蘭\">香草蘭</a>籽攪拌而成的棉花糖<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>。\n</p><p>到了現在，為了節省成本及容易大量生產，藥蜀葵的黏液已被<a href=\"/wiki/%E6%98%8E%E8%86%A0\" title=\"明膠\">明膠</a>所代替<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-科技大觀園&#95;3-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-科技大觀園-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>，成為棉花糖的主要材料之一。現時的棉花糖由<a href=\"/wiki/%E7%B3%96\" title=\"糖\">糖</a>或<a href=\"/wiki/%E7%8E%89%E7%B1%B3%E7%B3%96%E6%BC%BF\" title=\"玉米糖漿\">玉米糖漿</a>、攪拌了的<a href=\"/wiki/%E8%9B%8B%E7%99%BD\" title=\"蛋白\">蛋白</a>、用水軟化的明膠、合成香精和穩定劑所製成的糖果。\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"用途\"><span id=\".E7.94.A8.E9.80.94\"></span>用途</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E6%A3%89%E8%8A%B1%E8%BB%9F%E7%B3%96&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"編輯章節：用途\"><span>編輯</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"燒烤\"><span id=\".E7.87.92.E7.83.A4\"></span>燒烤</h3><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E6%A3%89%E8%8A%B1%E8%BB%9F%E7%B3%96&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"編輯章節：燒烤\"><span>編輯</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:USMC-090412-M-3035-007.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c2/USMC-090412-M-3035-007.jpg/250px-USMC-090412-M-3035-007.jpg?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"270\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c2/USMC-090412-M-3035-007.jpg/500px-USMC-090412-M-3035-007.jpg?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"3888\" /></a><figcaption>燒烤後的棉花糖</figcaption></figure>\n<p>經火或烤爐燒烤後的棉花糖，外表香脆，有點糖漿黏在表面，內部有些溶化而且十分軟。最好用較結實、較大顆、沒有夾心的原味棉花糖來燒烤。這樣可以預防整顆溶掉及不會太甜。\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"烘焙／烹飪\"><span id=\".E7.83.98.E7.84.99.EF.BC.8F.E7.83.B9.E9.A3.AA\"></span>烘焙／烹飪</h3><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E6%A3%89%E8%8A%B1%E8%BB%9F%E7%B3%96&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"編輯章節：烘焙／烹飪\"><span>編輯</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p>由於棉花糖遇熱即融化，所以不少人烘焙甜品時（特別是<a href=\"/wiki/%E6%9B%B2%E5%A5%87%E9%A4%85\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"餅乾\">餅乾</a>、<a href=\"/wiki/%E8%9B%8B%E7%B3%95\" title=\"蛋糕\">蛋糕</a>、<a href=\"/wiki/%E5%B7%A7%E5%85%8B%E5%8A%9B%E5%B8%83%E6%9C%97%E5%B0%BC\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"巧克力布朗尼\">巧克力布朗尼</a>）都會加入棉花糖，令味道更特別；另外有一種做法是煮溶棉花糖（或以<a href=\"/wiki/%E5%BE%AE%E6%B3%A2%E7%88%90\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"微波爐\">微波爐</a>熱熔之），再加入餡料，待棉花糖涼掉凝固後便成了棉花糖<a href=\"/wiki/%E5%B8%83%E4%B8%81\" title=\"布丁\">布丁</a>。\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"飲料\"><span id=\".E9.A3.B2.E6.96.99\"></span>飲料</h3><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E6%A3%89%E8%8A%B1%E8%BB%9F%E7%B3%96&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"編輯章節：飲料\"><span>編輯</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p>通常很小顆的棉花糖會被放在熱飲料上（特別是熱<a href=\"/wiki/%E5%B7%A7%E5%85%8B%E5%8A%9B\" title=\"巧克力\">巧克力</a>或加了奶類的<a href=\"/wiki/%E5%92%96%E5%95%A1\" title=\"咖啡\">咖啡</a>），待片刻後，會有一些棉花糖會溶掉，令熱飲料更甜、更香，拌後與飲料一同飲用。\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"冰淇淋\"><span id=\".E5.86.B0.E6.B7.87.E6.B7.8B\"></span>冰淇淋</h3><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E6%A3%89%E8%8A%B1%E8%BB%9F%E7%B3%96&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"編輯章節：冰淇淋\"><span>編輯</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p>有一種美國巧克力<a href=\"/wiki/%E5%86%B0%E6%B7%87%E6%B7%8B\" title=\"冰淇淋\">冰淇淋</a>，稱為<a href=\"/wiki/%E7%9F%B3%E6%9D%BF%E8%A1%97%E5%86%B0%E6%B7%87%E6%B7%8B\" title=\"石板街冰淇淋\">石板街冰淇淋</a>，被加入較小顆的棉花糖和果仁。\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"巧克力噴泉\"><span id=\".E5.B7.A7.E5.85.8B.E5.8A.9B.E5.99.B4.E6.B3.89\"></span>巧克力噴泉</h3><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E6%A3%89%E8%8A%B1%E8%BB%9F%E7%B3%96&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"編輯章節：巧克力噴泉\"><span>編輯</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p>以竹籤串成一串的棉花糖，有時會被用來搭配<a href=\"/wiki/%E5%B7%A7%E5%85%8B%E5%8A%9B%E5%99%B4%E6%B3%89\" title=\"巧克力噴泉\">巧克力噴泉</a>食用。\n</p>\n<center>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-traditional\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px; height: 150px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Marshmallows.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"棉花糖\"><img alt=\"棉花糖\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c9/Marshmallows.jpg/120px-Marshmallows.jpg?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"90\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c9/Marshmallows.jpg/250px-Marshmallows.jpg?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"851\" data-file-height=\"638\" /></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">棉花糖</div>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px; height: 150px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:RoastingMarshmallow.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"烤棉花糖\"><img alt=\"烤棉花糖\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/de/RoastingMarshmallow.jpg/120px-RoastingMarshmallow.jpg?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"84\" height=\"120\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/de/RoastingMarshmallow.jpg/250px-RoastingMarshmallow.jpg?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"726\" data-file-height=\"1034\" /></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">烤棉花糖</div>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px; height: 150px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Nutella_milkshake_with_toasted_marshmallows_-_Flipburger_Boutique.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"巧克力榛果奶昔上的棉花糖\"><img alt=\"巧克力榛果奶昔上的棉花糖\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/ce/Nutella_milkshake_with_toasted_marshmallows_-_Flipburger_Boutique.jpg/120px-Nutella_milkshake_with_toasted_marshmallows_-_Flipburger_Boutique.jpg?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"120\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/ce/Nutella_milkshake_with_toasted_marshmallows_-_Flipburger_Boutique.jpg/250px-Nutella_milkshake_with_toasted_marshmallows_-_Flipburger_Boutique.jpg?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"1728\" data-file-height=\"2592\" /></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">巧克力榛果奶昔上的棉花糖</div>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px; height: 150px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Strawberry_jam_marshmallow.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"草莓果醬夾心棉花糖\"><img alt=\"草莓果醬夾心棉花糖\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4a/Strawberry_jam_marshmallow.jpg/120px-Strawberry_jam_marshmallow.jpg?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"80\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4a/Strawberry_jam_marshmallow.jpg/250px-Strawberry_jam_marshmallow.jpg?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"3056\" data-file-height=\"2033\" /></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">草莓果醬夾心棉花糖</div>\n\t\t</li>\n</ul>\n</center>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"相关条目\"><span id=\".E7.9B.B8.E5.85.B3.E6.9D.A1.E7.9B.AE\"></span>相關條目</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E6%A3%89%E8%8A%B1%E8%BB%9F%E7%B3%96&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"編輯章節：相關條目\"><span>編輯</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%A3%89%E8%8A%B1%E7%B3%96_(%E6%A3%89%E7%B5%AE%E7%8B%80)\" title=\"棉花糖 (棉絮狀)\">棉花糖 (棉絮狀)</a></li></ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"參考資料\"><span id=\".E5.8F.83.E8.80.83.E8.B3.87.E6.96.99\"></span>參考資料</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\